{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/11/2026UMJ53m6W1Y1793701754.webp?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>《美食新聞報道》首站由張與辰帶領蔡景行，一同前往位於廟街、擁有 44 年歷史的「最強煲仔飯」老字號。除了馳名的煲仔飯外，小店的大排檔鑊氣小炒同樣令人讚不絕口。</p><p><br/>一、 興記菜館：廟街44年歷史的經典煲仔飯與大排檔鑊氣小炒</p><p>位於油麻地廟街的「興記菜館」擁有44年歷史，是本地遠近馳名的老字號。除了馳名的煲仔飯外，小店的大排檔鑊氣小炒同樣令人讚不絕口。</p><ul><li><p>煎蠔餅：外酥內嫩，裏面的蠔仔肥美爽口且極具新鮮感，搭配特製海鮮辣醬能完美解油提味。</p></li><li><p>辣酒炒大蜆：選用肉質厚實且富彈性的沙白，吸飽辣酒香氣，惹味十足。</p></li><li><p>鹹魚肉餅煲仔飯：作為重頭戲，這道飯選用了帶有輕微發酵獨特香氣的梅香鮫魚，配合肉餅的鮮美油脂。米飯方面指定採用頂級泰國茉莉香米，經煲仔慢火烘烤後，飯粒格外煙韌香口、焦香四溢，充分展現出傳統煲仔飯的極致風味。</p></li></ul><p>店舖資料：</p><ul><li><p>地址：油麻地廟街12、14、15、17、19號地舖</p></li></ul><p><p><img alt=\"1e0d75c9-5afc-4c21-9804-3b3dfcfbc880.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/11/2026sQ3yF5dZnb1793701757.webp?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"df14c60e-8488-4a2e-8a95-bf471885c498.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/11/2026iipJK5ukkc1793701756.webp?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"0240fe46-9675-4759-b3c6-83d4ef9d333a.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/11/2026SrIJ5cMdqw1793701756.webp?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"84ff434e-619e-4c3f-8500-fbb7c6b9a9ec.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/11/2026rkTL5s23V51793701756.webp?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p></p><p>二、 中環飯店：中環一級歷史建築內的頂級新派粵菜</p><p>位於中環畢打街一級歷史建築物內的「中環飯店」，由名廚坐鎮，主打頂級奢華的新派粵菜。</p><ul><li><p>溏心熟醉富貴蝦：前菜以淡雅的酒香浸潤鮮甜蝦肉，入口帶有膏脂的甘香與熟醉的綿密口感，令人印象深刻。</p></li><li><p>雞油花雕蒸花蟹配自家製手拉陳村粉：主菜選用體型巨大、蟹腳幾乎與人手等長的頂級花蟹，肉質飽滿扎實。配合雞油與花雕酒蒸製，令陳村粉充分吸收了花蟹的鮮甜與酒香精華。</p></li><li><p>辣不辣韭菜生煸方脷：展現了極高超的油炸技巧，魚肉細嫩極致滑口，外層與魚骨卻酥脆至連骨皆可食用，香辣惹味，堪稱送飯一流。</p></li><li><p>片皮雞二食：呈獻雙重驚喜：一食以炸至金黃酥脆的饅頭為底，鋪上香脆雞皮與奢華魚子醬；二食則採用經典的避風塘炒法，蒜香濃郁。</p></li></ul><p>店舖資料：</p><ul><li><p>地址：中環畢打街12號畢打行LG樓</p></li></ul><p><p><img alt=\"a41a6742-2b5f-4094-8072-0101f20b318b.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/11/20269w1K8PBGXy1793701755.webp?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"21bff785-2d89-441d-9e26-d50e101d94a3.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/11/2026E9lZpNdbS01793701755.webp?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"7f30b160-442f-482f-b3ae-cc9ae37f7bad.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/11/2026kEJYsVWyZh1793701755.webp?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"d2ccde19-f881-492c-893f-22bc3d1b7a2c.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/11/2026QRUHCSp0Gk1793701754.webp?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-04T14:25:47.666479+00:00","quality":{"score":2,"chars":724,"images":9,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-04T13:26:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-04T17:58:42.490884+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-04T14:18:32.117395+00:00","content_hash":"1fee95c5b539ed88b7f4480d2a599ba3702e10c01191c10d3cfe196eefa41e2b","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}